{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"origin" "-432 -1000 232"
"targetname" "about_box"
"title" "SBO 2.0.0 Showcase"
"message" "This map shows what is new in Syndicate Black Ops 2.0.0.\n\nLabels: point_worldtext, text drawn in the world.\nMaterials: footsteps and impacts differ by surface.\nAurora particles (env_particle): smoke, sparks, fire, fireflies.\nLight styles: flicker, pulse, power failure (trigger_lightstyle).\nFades: a crate fades out, in and to a ghost (env_render).\nModel scale: big and tiny models, smooth growing (env_render), random 3x monsters to fight.\nWashroom: mirrors on a wall and a floor (env_mirror).\nApache: a helicopter fires real rockets at you from its yard.\nCourtyard: 3D sky, rain and snow, grass, jump pads, safe falls.\nDay / night (global_light_control), map fog on / off and a fog zone.\n\nGoal: climb the courtyard tower and press the button: a 10 s countdown (game_timer), then the mission ends."
"distance" "0"
}
